    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like cute cats?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come to &quot;Where's my kitty?&quot;! Participate in this grand cat-finding party and use your sharp eyes and smart mind to discover every cat hidden in the party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Goal]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gameplay]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find all the hidden cute cats in the shortest time, catch them, and enjoy the fun of discovering cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Unique Scene]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From rural areas to neighborhoods, from markets to New Year, you can find cute cats hidden in various scenes. Discover the cats in each scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The Strongest Brain]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through different scenes, exercise your brain, improve your observation skills, find hidden cats, and hone the strongest brain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Many postures]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cat hides in different postures, find them and feel the magic of cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Feel the Cat\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cat hidden in the scene is unique. Find them, listen to their calls and experience the charm of cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to cuddle your cat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to hug the cat? Download &quot;Where's my kitty?&quot; now and start a warm cat-finding journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like cute cats?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come to &quot;Where's my kitty?&quot;! Participate in this grand cat-finding party and use your sharp eyes and smart mind to discover every cat hidden in the party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Goal]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gameplay]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find all the hidden cute cats in the shortest time, catch them, and enjoy the fun of discovering cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Unique Scene]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From rural areas to neighborhoods, from markets to New Year, you can find cute cats hidden in various scenes. Discover the cats in each scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The Strongest Brain]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through different scenes, exercise your brain, improve your observation skills, find hidden cats, and hone the strongest brain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Many postures]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cat hides in different postures, find them and feel the magic of cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Feel the Cat\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cat hidden in the scene is unique. Find them, listen to their calls and experience the charm of cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to cuddle your cat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to hug the cat? Download &quot;Where's my kitty?&quot; now and start a warm cat-finding journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
